{"text":"kuruntokai","n":33,"lines":["அன்னாய் இவனோர் இளமா ணாக்கன்","தன்னூர் மன்றத் தென்னன் கொல்லோ","இரந்தூ ணிரம்பா மேனியொடு","விருந்தின் ஊரும் பெருஞ்செம் மலனே"],"tr":["aṉṉāy ivaṉōr iḷamā ṇākkaṉ","taṉṉūr maṉṟat teṉṉaṉ kollō","irantū ṇirampā mēṉiyoṭu","viruntiṉ ūrum peruñcem malaṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"படுமரத்து மோசிகீரனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Paṭumarattu Mōcikīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 7, veṇṭaḷai 6, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அன்னாய்","tr":"aṉṉāy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாய்","tr":"ṉāy"}]},{"text":"இவனோர்","tr":"ivaṉōr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இவ","tr":"iva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோர்","tr":"ṉōr"}]},{"text":"இளமா","tr":"iḷamā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இள","tr":"iḷa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"ணாக்கன்","tr":"ṇākkaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணாக்","tr":"ṇāk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கன்","tr":"kaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"தன்னூர்","tr":"taṉṉūr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னூர்","tr":"ṉūr"}]},{"text":"மன்றத்","tr":"maṉṟat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றத்","tr":"ṟat"}]},{"text":"தென்னன்","tr":"teṉṉaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னன்","tr":"ṉaṉ"}]},{"text":"கொல்லோ","tr":"kollō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"}]}],[{"text":"இரந்தூ","tr":"irantū","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரந்","tr":"iran"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"}]},{"text":"ணிரம்பா","tr":"ṇirampā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணிரம்","tr":"ṇiram"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"}]},{"text":"மேனியொடு","tr":"mēṉiyoṭu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னியொ","tr":"ṉiyo"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]}],[{"text":"விருந்தின்","tr":"viruntiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விருந்","tr":"virun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தின்","tr":"tiṉ"}]},{"text":"ஊரும்","tr":"ūrum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊ","tr":"ū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]},{"text":"பெருஞ்செம்","tr":"peruñcem","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருஞ்","tr":"peruñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"செம்","tr":"cem"}]},{"text":"மலனே","tr":"malaṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மல","tr":"mala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அன்னாய்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னாய்","lemma":"அன்னை","gloss":"mother/friend"}],"gloss":"Oh mother/friend"},{"surface":"இவன்","parts":[{"text":"இவன்","lemma":"இவன்","gloss":"this man"}],"gloss":"this man"},{"surface":"ஓர்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"a / one"},{"surface":"இள","parts":[{"text":"இள","lemma":"இளமை","gloss":"youth/young"}],"gloss":"young"},{"surface":"மாணாக்கன்","parts":[{"text":"மாணாக்கன்","lemma":"மாணாக்கன்","gloss":"student"}],"gloss":"student"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தன்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"ஊர்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"}],"gloss":"town"},{"surface":"மன்றத்து","parts":[{"text":"மன்றத்து","lemma":"மன்றம்","gloss":"assembly place"}],"gloss":"of the assembly place"},{"surface":"என்னன்","parts":[{"text":"என்னன்","lemma":"என்னன்","gloss":"what kind of man"}],"gloss":"what kind of man"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"particle of wonder"}],"gloss":"I wonder"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரந்து","parts":[{"text":"இரந்து","lemma":"இர","gloss":"beg"}],"gloss":"having begged"},{"surface":"ஊண்","parts":[{"text":"ஊண்","lemma":"ஊண்","gloss":"food"}],"gloss":"food"},{"surface":"நிரம்பா","parts":[{"text":"நிரம்பா","lemma":"நிரம்பு","gloss":"fill"}],"gloss":"unsatisfied / unfilled"},{"surface":"மேனியொடு","parts":[{"text":"மேனி","lemma":"மேனி","gloss":"body"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with a body"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விருந்தின்","parts":[{"text":"விருந்தின்","lemma":"விருந்து","gloss":"guest/newness"}],"gloss":"as a guest"},{"surface":"ஊரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஊரும்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"crawl/move"}],"gloss":"crawling / entering slowly"},{"surface":"பெருஞ்","parts":[{"text":"பெருஞ்","lemma":"பெருஞ்","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செம்மலனே","parts":[{"text":"செம்மலன்","lemma":"செம்மல்","gloss":"proud man/lord"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"proud man indeed"}]}],"literal":"Oh mother, this man is a young student! / In the common ground of his own town, what is he, I wonder? / With a body not filled by begged food, / he crawls in like a guest, this great proud man!","translation":"Oh mother, this man is like a young student! I wonder what he is like in the assembly ground of his own town. With a body unsatisfied by the food he begged, he creeps in like a guest, this great, proud lord!","modern":"அன்னையே! இவன் ஒரு இளைய மாணவன் போல இருக்கிறான். தன் ஊரின் பொதுமன்றத்தில் இவன் எப்படிப்பட்டவனாக இருப்பானோ? இரந்து உண்ட உணவினால் இன்னும் நிறையாத உடம்போடு, புதிய விருந்தினனைப் போல மெல்ல நுழைந்து வருகிறான், இந்தத் தற்பெருமை உடைய தலைவன்!","explanation":"In this Marutam poem, the heroine speaks mockingly to her foster-mother or friend about her unfaithful husband who has returned from his courtesan. To appease her anger and gain entry into the house, he humbles himself, acting submissive like a young, poor student begging for food. The heroine sarcastically wonders how such a great, proud lord behaves in his own town's public assembly, contrasting it with his current pathetic, crawling posture. This imagery perfectly fits the Marutam landscape, which deals with infidelity, sulking, and the husband's deceptive attempts at reconciliation. Key words like 'iḷamāṇākkaṉ' (young student) and 'cemmalaṉ' (proud lord) highlight the sharp irony of his behavior.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}